---
import MainLayout from "../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";

const pageTitle =
    "Basement & Crawl Space Flood Cleanup in Florida | Paramount";
const pageDescription =
    "Rapid water extraction for flooded basements and crawl spaces in Florida. Prevent mold and structural rot with our 60-minute emergency response. Licensed & Insured.";
---

<MainLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
    image="/images/basement-flooding-og.jpg"
    schemaType="Service"
>
    <!-- Custom Styles for this page -->
    <style>
        .hotspot-dot {
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.7);
            }
            70% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0);
            }
            100% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(249, 115, 22, 0);
            }
        }
    </style>

    <!-- Sticky Alert Bar -->
    <div
        class="sticky top-20 z-40 bg-[#fff5eb] border-b border-orange-200 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm"
    >
        <div
            class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-center sm:text-left"
        >
            <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-600 font-bold text-sm md:text-base"
            >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]"
                    >warning</span
                >
                <span
                    >Standing water in your basement or crawl space? Don't enter
                    without safety gear.</span
                >
            </div>
            <a
                class="flex-shrink-0 bg-[#f97316] hover:bg-orange-600 text-white text-sm font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors animate-pulse"
                href="tel:7866022217"
            >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">bolt</span>
                EMERGENCY PUMP-OUT: (786) 602-2217
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Abstract background pattern -->
        <div
            class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-blue-50 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10 py-12 lg:py-20 relative z-10"
        >
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
                <!-- Content -->
                <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6">
                    <div
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 w-fit"
                    >
                        <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]"
                            >verified</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="text-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide"
                            >The Dry-Out Promise</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h1
                        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight"
                    >
                        Basement & Crawl Space <span class="text-primary"
                            >Flood Cleanup</span
                        > in Florida
                    </h1>
                    <p
                        class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-xl"
                    >
                        Rapid water extraction, mold prevention, and structural
                        drying. Don't let standing water destroy your
                        foundation. We arrive within 60 minutes.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Trust Indicators Grid -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                                >verified_user</span
                            >
                            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900"
                                >Licensed Mold Assessors</span
                            >
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                                >schedule</span
                            >
                            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900"
                                >24/7 Availability</span
                            >
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                                >request_quote</span
                            >
                            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900"
                                >Direct Insurance Billing</span
                            >
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-4">
                        <a
                            href="tel:7866022217"
                            class="flex-1 sm:flex-none cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg h-12 px-6 bg-primary hover:bg-blue-600 text-white text-base font-bold transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20 flex text-center"
                        >
                            Get a Free Moisture Inspection
                        </a>
                        <a
                            href="/service-areas/"
                            class="flex-1 sm:flex-none cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg h-12 px-6 bg-white border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-primary text-slate-900 text-base font-bold transition-colors flex text-center"
                        >
                            View Service Area
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hero Image -->
                <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-xl lg:max-w-none">
                    <div
                        class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl aspect-[4/3] group"
                    >
                        <!-- Image -->
                        <div
                            class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
                            data-alt="Restoration technician standing in water wearing protective gear and using professional water pump equipment"
                            style="background-image: url('/assets/images/restoration/water-damage/basement-technician.webp');"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <!-- Overlay gradient -->
                        <div
                            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <!-- Floating Badge -->
                        <div
                            class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 p-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl border border-white/20 shadow-lg"
                        >
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                <div
                                    class="bg-green-100 p-2 rounded-full text-green-600"
                                >
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined"
                                        >check_circle</span
                                    >
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">
                                        Active Response Team
                                    </p>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
                                        Currently deployed in Tampa, Miami, and
                                        Orlando areas.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Florida Context Block -->
    <section class="bg-slate-50 py-16 border-y border-slate-200">
        <div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm border border-slate-100"
            >
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
                    <div class="md:w-1/3 w-full">
                        <div
                            class="bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 h-full flex flex-col justify-center"
                        >
                            <span
                                class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-4"
                                >water</span
                            >
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
                                Florida Context
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                                Understanding the unique challenges of our local
                                water table.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="md:w-2/3">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
                            Understanding Below-Grade Water Damage in Florida
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                            Florida's high water table and humid climate create
                            a "perfect storm" for basement and crawl space
                            issues. Unlike northern basements that may dry
                            naturally, Florida's below-grade spaces act as
                            moisture sponges.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            Even a small amount of standing water can lead to
                            rapid microbial growth within 24-48 hours. Our
                            specialized equipment is calibrated specifically for
                            Florida's atmospheric conditions to ensure a
                            complete structural dry-out.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Service Solutions Bento Grid -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">
                    Complete Restoration Solutions
                </h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
                    From initial extraction to final encapsulation, we handle
                    every step of the recovery process.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div
                    class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all border border-transparent hover:border-primary/20"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]"
                            >thunderstorm</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Emergency Pump-Out
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Industrial-grade submersible pumps remove thousands of
                        gallons per hour to stop damage instantly.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        class="inline-flex items-center text-orange-600 font-bold text-sm hover:underline"
                        href="/restoration/water-damage/emergency-water-removal/"
                    >
                        Learn more <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] ml-1"
                            >arrow_forward</span
                        >
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div
                    class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all border border-transparent hover:border-primary/20"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]"
                            >shield</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Space Encapsulation
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Sealing crawl spaces with heavy-duty vapor barriers to
                        prevent future moisture intrusion and mold.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        class="inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold text-sm hover:underline"
                        href="/restoration/mold-remediation/prevention/"
                    >
                        Learn more <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] ml-1"
                            >arrow_forward</span
                        >
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div
                    class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all border border-transparent hover:border-primary/20"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]"
                            >sanitizer</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Sewage Decontamination
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Safe removal of biohazards and Category 3 water,
                        followed by hospital-grade sanitization.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        class="inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold text-sm hover:underline"
                        href="/restoration/water-damage/sewage-cleanup/"
                    >
                        Learn more <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] ml-1"
                            >arrow_forward</span
                        >
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div
                    class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all border border-transparent hover:border-primary/20"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                    >
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]"
                            >air</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                        Dehumidification
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Advanced desiccant dehumidifiers that pull moisture from
                        structural beams and subflooring.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        class="inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold text-sm hover:underline"
                        href="/restoration/water-damage/structural-drying/"
                    >
                        Learn more <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] ml-1"
                            >arrow_forward</span
                        >
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Technical Section & Interactive Element -->
    <section class="bg-[#101922] text-white py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/cubes.png')] opacity-5"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10 relative z-10">
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16">
                <!-- Left: Answer First List -->
                <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">
                        What to do when your basement floods?
                    </h2>
                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <div class="flex gap-6">
                            <div
                                class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl"
                            >
                                1
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">
                                    Shut Off Power Immediately
                                </h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                                    Water and electricity are a lethal
                                    combination. If your breaker box is in the
                                    flooded area, do not enter. Call your
                                    utility company first.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-6">
                            <div
                                class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl"
                            >
                                2
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">
                                    Stop the Water Source
                                </h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                                    If it's a burst pipe, turn off the main
                                    water valve. If it's storm flooding, focus
                                    on safety and evacuation if necessary.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-6">
                            <div
                                class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl"
                            >
                                3
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">
                                    Document for Insurance
                                </h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                                    Before cleanup begins, take photos and
                                    videos of the water level and damaged items.
                                    This is crucial for your claim.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-6">
                            <div
                                class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl"
                            >
                                4
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">
                                    Call Paramount Restoration
                                </h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                                    Time is the enemy. Call <span
                                        class="text-orange-500 font-bold"
                                        >(786) 602-2217</span
                                    > for emergency extraction to prevent mold setting
                                    in.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right: Interactive Diagram (Static Implementation) -->
                <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                    <div
                        class="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10"
                    >
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                            <h3
                                class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2"
                            >
                                <span
                                    class="material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500"
                                    >warning</span
                                >
                                The Hidden Dangers
                            </h3>
                            <span
                                class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest"
                                >Structural Analysis</span
                            >
                        </div>

                        <!-- Diagram Container -->
                        <div
                            class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden aspect-video bg-slate-800"
                        >
                            <!-- Background Image representing basement cross-section -->
                            <div
                                class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center opacity-50"
                                data-alt="Cross section diagram of a house foundation showing soil, concrete wall, and water table"
                                style="background-image: url('/assets/images/restoration/water-damage/basement-diagram.webp');"
                            >
                            </div>

                            <!-- Hotspots -->
                            <!-- Hotspot 1: Wall -->
                            <div
                                class="absolute top-[30%] left-[20%] group cursor-pointer z-20"
                            >
                                <div
                                    class="hotspot-dot w-6 h-6 bg-orange-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg"
                                >
                                </div>
                                <div
                                    class="absolute left-8 top-0 bg-white text-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-xl w-48 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none group-hover:pointer-events-auto z-30"
                                >
                                    <h4
                                        class="font-bold text-sm mb-1 text-red-600"
                                    >
                                        Hydrostatic Pressure
                                    </h4>
                                    <p class="text-xs">
                                        Water pressure builds outside walls,
                                        forcing moisture through concrete pores.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Hotspot 2: Floor/Corner -->
                            <div
                                class="absolute bottom-[20%] left-[40%] group cursor-pointer z-20"
                            >
                                <div
                                    class="hotspot-dot w-6 h-6 bg-orange-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg"
                                >
                                </div>
                                <div
                                    class="absolute left-8 top-[-50px] bg-white text-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-xl w-48 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none group-hover:pointer-events-auto z-30"
                                >
                                    <h4
                                        class="font-bold text-sm mb-1 text-red-600"
                                    >
                                        Foundation Cracks
                                    </h4>
                                    <p class="text-xs">
                                        Water seepage erodes soil support,
                                        leading to settling and major structural
                                        cracks.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Hotspot 3: Air -->
                            <div
                                class="absolute top-[20%] right-[30%] group cursor-pointer z-20"
                            >
                                <div
                                    class="hotspot-dot w-6 h-6 bg-orange-500 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg"
                                >
                                </div>
                                <div
                                    class="absolute right-8 top-0 bg-white text-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-xl w-48 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none group-hover:pointer-events-auto z-30"
                                >
                                    <h4
                                        class="font-bold text-sm mb-1 text-red-600"
                                    >
                                        Airborne Spores
                                    </h4>
                                    <p class="text-xs">
                                        Damp air circulates upward, spreading
                                        mold spores to living areas above.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Overlay instruction -->
                            <div
                                class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-black/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs text-white backdrop-blur-sm pointer-events-none"
                            >
                                Hover over dots to see risks
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Social Proof & Testimonial -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
        <div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
            <div
                class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-md relative overflow-hidden"
            >
                <!-- Decorative quote mark -->
                <span
                    class="absolute top-4 right-8 text-9xl text-primary/5 font-serif leading-none select-none"
                    >"</span
                >

                <div
                    class="md:w-1/3 flex flex-col items-center text-center border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-gray-100 pb-8 md:pb-0 md:pr-8"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gray-200 mb-4 overflow-hidden"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center"
                            data-alt="Portrait of Sarah J., a happy customer from Tampa"
                            style="background-image: url('/assets/images/restoration/water-damage/basement-flooding-testimonial.webp');"
                        >
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Sarah J.</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2">
                        Homeowner in Tampa, FL
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex text-yellow-400">
                        <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] fill-current"
                            >star</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] fill-current"
                            >star</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] fill-current"
                            >star</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] fill-current"
                            >star</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] fill-current"
                            >star</span
                        >
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="md:w-2/3">
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
                        "Saved our wood floors after the storm"
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed italic">
                        "I thought our entire first floor was a goner after the
                        crawl space flooded and wicked up the walls. Paramount
                        got here in under an hour with huge fans and pumps. They
                        handled the insurance directly, and we didn't have to
                        replace the hardwood. Incredible service."
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 text-center mb-12">
                Frequently Asked Questions
            </h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <details class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
                    <summary
                        class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 list-none"
                    >
                        <span
                            >Does homeowners insurance cover flood cleanup?</span
                        >
                        <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined"
                                >expand_more</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="text-slate-600 px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        It depends on the source. "Flood" insurance typically
                        covers rising water from outside (storms), while
                        standard policies often cover sudden internal issues
                        like burst pipes. We work directly with your adjuster to
                        maximize your coverage entitlement and handle the
                        billing for you.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
                    <summary
                        class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 list-none"
                    >
                        <span>How long does the drying process take?</span>
                        <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined"
                                >expand_more</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="text-slate-600 px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Most residential drying projects take between 3 to 5
                        days. However, dense materials like hardwood or concrete
                        in basements may require specialized heating equipment
                        and take slightly longer. We monitor moisture levels
                        daily to ensure it's truly dry.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
                    <summary
                        class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 list-none"
                    >
                        <span>Can you save my wood floors if they got wet?</span
                        >
                        <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined"
                                >expand_more</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="text-slate-600 px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Often, yes! If we can begin the extraction and drying
                        process within the first 24 hours using our injectable
                        drying mats and industrial dehumidifiers, we can often
                        draw the moisture out before the wood permanently warps
