                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="group bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
                    <summary
                        class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 font-bold text-slate-900 list-none"
                    >
                        <span>Is the mold dangerous right away?</span>
